<title>UK: Danone unit prices $100 million three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Danone unit prices $100 million three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been priced, lead manager Citibank International said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DANONE FINANCE</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  GROUPE DANONE</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     6.375     MATURITY    25.FEB.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.163   PAY DATE    25.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.963    SPREAD	+15 BP</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS UK/US/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.175     SELL CONC  1.20</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 5.875 PCT NOVEMBER 1999 U.S. TREASURY NOTE -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
